flowchart TD
    A[Fake virus warning appears on screen] --> B[Victim calls the number shown]
    B --> C[Caller asks to install remote-access software to fix it]
    C --> D[Caller can now see everything - bank pages, passwords, email]
    D --> E[Caller demands payment by gift card or money transfer]
    E --> F{Family has a safe-number list?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Hang up. Call the bank using the list, not the callers number]
    F -->|No| H[Money sent this way cannot be traced or returned]
